  "guide": {
    "by": "Written by your Hermes model",
    "guide": [
      {
        "text": "These sources are the Fernwood Tool Library's FY2026 annual report and the board's September 16, 2026 meeting notes.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P1",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Fy26 annual report",
            "locator": "“Fernwood Tool Library: FY2026 Annual Report (Sample)”",
            "source_id": "s_359939266b15"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P12",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Board notes",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_f1014e6948ec"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Demand grew fast: 1,962 members, up from 1,410, and 9,840 loans, up from 7,215.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P3",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Fy26 annual report",
            "locator": "“The year in numbers”",
            "source_id": "s_359939266b15"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Hours hold members back most: 47% named them, 61% in Millbrook, and 344 holds were waiting on June 30.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Fy26 annual report",
            "locator": "“What members told us”",
            "source_id": "s_359939266b15"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Fy26 annual report",
            "locator": "“The waiting list”",
            "source_id": "s_359939266b15"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P6",
            "n": 3,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Fy26 annual report",
            "locator": "“Where members live”",
            "source_id": "s_359939266b15"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The year closed even at $212,400, but the reserve is $31,000, about seven weeks, against a three-month goal.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Fy26 annual report",
            "locator": "“Money”",
            "source_id": "s_359939266b15"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P8",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Fy26 annual report",
            "locator": "“Money”",
            "source_id": "s_359939266b15"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P14",
            "n": 3,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Board notes",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_f1014e6948ec"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The board voted to ask the Alder Falls Community Fund for $46,500 a year for two years to open 34 hours a week.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P16",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Board notes",
            "locator": "para. 5",
            "source_id": "s_f1014e6948ec"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P17",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Board notes",
            "locator": "para. 6",
            "source_id": "s_f1014e6948ec"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "asks": [
      {
        "id": "a1",
        "who": "The board",
        "what": "A short deck making the case for longer hours",
        "by": "October 30",
        "kind": "deck",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P17",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Board notes",
            "locator": "para. 6",
            "source_id": "s_f1014e6948ec"
          }
        ],
        "brief": {
          "who": "The Community Fund's program officer",
          "goal": "Fund a part-time coordinator so the library opens longer hours",
          "length": "A short deck"
        }
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "text": "The reserve is $31,000, about seven weeks, short of the three-month goal. The budget rises from $212,400 to $258,900, up $46,500. How will the reserve keep pace?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Fy26 annual report",
            "locator": "“Money”",
            "source_id": "s_359939266b15"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P8",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Fy26 annual report",
            "locator": "“Money”",
            "source_id": "s_359939266b15"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P10",
            "n": 3,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Fy26 annual report",
            "locator": "“Looking ahead”",
            "source_id": "s_359939266b15"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "The Fund ask covers $46,500 a year for two years, but the $50,000 city grant runs only one more year before reapplying. What happens if the city grant lapses?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P8",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Fy26 annual report",
            "locator": "“Money”",
            "source_id": "s_359939266b15"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P14",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Board notes",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_f1014e6948ec"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P17",
            "n": 3,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Board notes",
            "locator": "para. 6",
            "source_id": "s_f1014e6948ec"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Millbrook holds 22% of the city's renters but only 9% of members, and 61% there named hours. Will evenings and Saturdays alone close that gap?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P6",
            "n": 1,
